  "prefLabel": "Ins 4001.01 Purpose and Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 4001.01 Purpose and Scope. This chapter contains procedures and substantive requirements for the submission of health care data under RSA 420-G:11, II to the New Hampshire Comprehensive Health Information System by insurance companies, third-party payers, third-party administrators, pharmacy benefit managers, and carriers that provide administrative services for a plan sponsor.\n\nSource. #8279, eff 2-3-05; ss by #9500, eff 7-6-09; ss by #10877, eff 7-10-15; ss by #13136, eff 11-24-20; ss by #14560, eff 4-22-26, EXPIRES: 4-22-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ins4000.html"
